{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The English version is currently in development, but a demo version is available to play.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cMr. Admin... do you remember who you are?\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m Parker Klein, Executive Officer of Division 2 at ZF Corporation. \u00a0<br>You\u2019re the Head of Development in Division 1 \u2014 though after that little <strong>\u2018incident\u2019</strong> a few years back, I hear some of your memories got scrambled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ll keep this brief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/7142812a6be1aa08890dd5d5d97d8dd7.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three years ago, <strong>Earth was forever changed</strong>.<br>No one knows what caused it \u2014 some blame the sun, others say it was the planet itself turning against us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But we do know what followed: the fall of nations, mass extinctions\u2026 and the rise of one last sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucio City.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/dabd841457571ef200be61769ec31752.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1240 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Lucia Island after the Collapse, Lucio is the last autonomous megacity left \u2014 a symbol of survival, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/35dc97147d105074ec9a44ccadeec3c9.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath its glowing skyline lies a secret machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That machine\u2026 is you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/77291ca692401f9fb9b5651f394a19b8.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1240 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Administrator</strong>, director of the <strong>Lucio City Security Bureau</strong> \u2014 a covert organization answering to no one but the City\u2019s silent founders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say you lost part of your memory after the &quot;incident&quot; in Division 1.<br>But the city doesn\u2019t care.<br><br>It just needs someone to hold the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/c5ea89343b440c9d575ab3cbbd9ca3d0.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=1450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alongside the elite agents of the Security Bureau, who serve as your trusted aides, you will carry out your duties \u2014 and safeguard this unstable world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Each arc reveals a piece of the city\u2019s truth.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/a56bb3d91cbd0cc522dc652e61e926e5.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/7d67526fa56a0c6fb111175e1c28006f.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1240 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of attacks shake the Treeper Ward\u2019s most iconic building \u2014 the <strong>Department Store</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid chaos and rising public fear, the Bureau begins an investigation that leads to a truth even the agency wasn\u2019t meant to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/39458b0180b16b6b4abdf312ae7b0a1a.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=1920 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This episode features <strong>three characters</strong> from the Customer Center,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >along with <strong>hidden figures</strong> from Treeper Department Store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they form a story of how they come together to protect Treeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/1f7182c541286a2f4e5139d66518a081.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1520 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/e8962c32debe7ce6b29b78d077b1ad4c.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1240 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idol group <strong>Q.Seasons</strong> takes center stage \u2014 and so do the secrets surrounding their agency, <strong>SRC Entertainment</strong>, and national broadcaster <strong>LCBS</strong>.<br>When singer Yujin crosses paths with the Bureau, a story of loyalty, image, and manipulation begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/b87b381f483e8e1d51982fca636b4aee.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=2400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yujin, Satona, Jua,</strong> and <strong>Kylie</strong> form the four-member idol group <strong>Q.Seasons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the <strong>four seasons</strong> as their central concept, each member represents a unique charm:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the warmth of spring, the freshness of summer, the coolness of autumn, and the coziness of winter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/423d4dc4981a66680e72deddd4c2b336.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1520 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Lucio City hiding?</strong><br>And why were you chosen to uncover it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;We\u2019re counting on you, Mr. Admin.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/aa99434f7c7bab0162c40fae619464fd.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1520 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/39b5c0716385301c1ccc905206ebaa12.avif?t=1760257399\" width=680 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of <i>Eternal ONE</i> is divided into a <strong>main storyline</strong> and<strong> DLC episodes</strong>.<br>Each season offers exciting new stories, with even more content on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Main Story]</strong><br><strong>Part 1 </strong>\u2013 Service Center Arc<br><strong>Part 2 </strong>\u2013 Dark Studio Arc<br><strong>Part 3</strong> \u2013 Coming Soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/9631c89564567c752a0943a3fc2c966e.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like you're having a real conversation as characters react with a wide range of <strong>expressive emotions</strong>\u2014more facial variations await as the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/73975fb93855da554b6d6f75f305f0e9.poster.avif?t=1760257399\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/73975fb93855da554b6d6f75f305f0e9.webm?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/73975fb93855da554b6d6f75f305f0e9.mp4?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Eternal ONE</strong></i><strong> provides regular updates</strong> to reflect new stories and content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the update menu, you can download new episodes, limited-time events, bug fixes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/dc45d743716e3eeb8803625d72f15d0c.poster.avif?t=1760257399\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/dc45d743716e3eeb8803625d72f15d0c.webm?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/dc45d743716e3eeb8803625d72f15d0c.mp4?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal ONE offers <strong>multiple routes and endings</strong> in each arc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>true ending</strong> to <strong>bad endings</strong>, the story unfolds based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must overcome every false path and reach the true ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/83827a6c766ebe822d6c8739a57600bb.poster.avif?t=1760257399\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/83827a6c766ebe822d6c8739a57600bb.webm?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/83827a6c766ebe822d6c8739a57600bb.mp4?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode features stunning<strong> special CGs</strong> that heighten immersion and leave a lasting impression even after the story ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These visuals are key elements in the narrative of Eternal ONE, offering players a <strong>unique and moving experience</strong> through a rich variety of CGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/642193e5504dbb9aa2a69ac7ad2ac5a9.poster.avif?t=1760257399\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/642193e5504dbb9aa2a69ac7ad2ac5a9.webm?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/642193e5504dbb9aa2a69ac7ad2ac5a9.mp4?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various <strong>in-game features</strong> make you feel as if you're truly working as the administrator of Lucio City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deeper into the world through <strong>interactive content like emails, chat systems</strong>, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/06fc5bb6323e2f94050f3750a9667dbc.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1520 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Seoul to London to Tokyo \u2014 we\u2019re a global team turning imagination into reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our previous title, <i>Beginning of the Rain</i>, taught us more than just how to develop a game \u2014 it showed us how to grow with our audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe in building story-driven content that evolves through feedback, communication, and emotional connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our games aren\u2019t static; they\u2019re living, growing experiences shaped together with the players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/7c0ec89eac0a972f92af441e6abafd56.avif?t=1760257399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras_big/7c0ec89eac0a972f92af441e6abafd56.avif?t=1760257399 width=1600 height=956 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copyright <strong>\u00a9\u00a0</strong>HOONDAHL STUDIOS LTD 2025 / All Rights Reserved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3114280?t=1760257399","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/3578321fb3e432d11f15697ecd6829d005402710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760257399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/445e17d7d3c0c85da57aa3a31cbfb3494f45be0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760257399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/445e17d7d3c0c85da57aa3a31cbfb3494f45be0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760257399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The English version is currently in development, but a demo version is available to play.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cMr. Admin... do you remember who you are?\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m Parker Klein, Executive Officer of Division 2 at ZF Corporation. \u00a0<br>You\u2019re the Head of Development in Division 1 \u2014 though after that little <strong>\u2018incident\u2019</strong> a few years back, I hear some of your memories got scrambled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019ll keep this brief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/7142812a6be1aa08890dd5d5d97d8dd7.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three years ago, <strong>Earth was forever changed</strong>.<br>No one knows what caused it \u2014 some blame the sun, others say it was the planet itself turning against us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But we do know what followed: the fall of nations, mass extinctions\u2026 and the rise of one last sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucio City.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/dabd841457571ef200be61769ec31752.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1240 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Lucia Island after the Collapse, Lucio is the last autonomous megacity left \u2014 a symbol of survival, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/35dc97147d105074ec9a44ccadeec3c9.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath its glowing skyline lies a secret machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That machine\u2026 is you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/77291ca692401f9fb9b5651f394a19b8.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1240 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Administrator</strong>, director of the <strong>Lucio City Security Bureau</strong> \u2014 a covert organization answering to no one but the City\u2019s silent founders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say you lost part of your memory after the &quot;incident&quot; in Division 1.<br>But the city doesn\u2019t care.<br><br>It just needs someone to hold the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/c5ea89343b440c9d575ab3cbbd9ca3d0.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=1450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alongside the elite agents of the Security Bureau, who serve as your trusted aides, you will carry out your duties \u2014 and safeguard this unstable world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Each arc reveals a piece of the city\u2019s truth.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/a56bb3d91cbd0cc522dc652e61e926e5.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1500 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/7d67526fa56a0c6fb111175e1c28006f.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1240 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of attacks shake the Treeper Ward\u2019s most iconic building \u2014 the <strong>Department Store</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid chaos and rising public fear, the Bureau begins an investigation that leads to a truth even the agency wasn\u2019t meant to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/39458b0180b16b6b4abdf312ae7b0a1a.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=1920 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This episode features <strong>three characters</strong> from the Customer Center,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >along with <strong>hidden figures</strong> from Treeper Department Store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they form a story of how they come together to protect Treeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/1f7182c541286a2f4e5139d66518a081.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1520 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/e8962c32debe7ce6b29b78d077b1ad4c.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1240 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idol group <strong>Q.Seasons</strong> takes center stage \u2014 and so do the secrets surrounding their agency, <strong>SRC Entertainment</strong>, and national broadcaster <strong>LCBS</strong>.<br>When singer Yujin crosses paths with the Bureau, a story of loyalty, image, and manipulation begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/b87b381f483e8e1d51982fca636b4aee.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=2400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yujin, Satona, Jua,</strong> and <strong>Kylie</strong> form the four-member idol group <strong>Q.Seasons</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the <strong>four seasons</strong> as their central concept, each member represents a unique charm:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the warmth of spring, the freshness of summer, the coolness of autumn, and the coziness of winter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/423d4dc4981a66680e72deddd4c2b336.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1520 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What is Lucio City hiding?</strong><br>And why were you chosen to uncover it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;We\u2019re counting on you, Mr. Admin.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/aa99434f7c7bab0162c40fae619464fd.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1520 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/39b5c0716385301c1ccc905206ebaa12.avif?t=1760257399\" width=680 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story of <i>Eternal ONE</i> is divided into a <strong>main storyline</strong> and<strong> DLC episodes</strong>.<br>Each season offers exciting new stories, with even more content on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Main Story]</strong><br><strong>Part 1 </strong>\u2013 Service Center Arc<br><strong>Part 2 </strong>\u2013 Dark Studio Arc<br><strong>Part 3</strong> \u2013 Coming Soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/9631c89564567c752a0943a3fc2c966e.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1600 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like you're having a real conversation as characters react with a wide range of <strong>expressive emotions</strong>\u2014more facial variations await as the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/73975fb93855da554b6d6f75f305f0e9.poster.avif?t=1760257399\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/73975fb93855da554b6d6f75f305f0e9.webm?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/73975fb93855da554b6d6f75f305f0e9.mp4?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Eternal ONE</strong></i><strong> provides regular updates</strong> to reflect new stories and content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the update menu, you can download new episodes, limited-time events, bug fixes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/dc45d743716e3eeb8803625d72f15d0c.poster.avif?t=1760257399\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/dc45d743716e3eeb8803625d72f15d0c.webm?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/dc45d743716e3eeb8803625d72f15d0c.mp4?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal ONE offers <strong>multiple routes and endings</strong> in each arc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>true ending</strong> to <strong>bad endings</strong>, the story unfolds based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must overcome every false path and reach the true ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/83827a6c766ebe822d6c8739a57600bb.poster.avif?t=1760257399\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/83827a6c766ebe822d6c8739a57600bb.webm?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/83827a6c766ebe822d6c8739a57600bb.mp4?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each episode features stunning<strong> special CGs</strong> that heighten immersion and leave a lasting impression even after the story ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These visuals are key elements in the narrative of Eternal ONE, offering players a <strong>unique and moving experience</strong> through a rich variety of CGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/642193e5504dbb9aa2a69ac7ad2ac5a9.poster.avif?t=1760257399\" width=680 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/642193e5504dbb9aa2a69ac7ad2ac5a9.webm?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/642193e5504dbb9aa2a69ac7ad2ac5a9.mp4?t=1760257399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various <strong>in-game features</strong> make you feel as if you're truly working as the administrator of Lucio City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deeper into the world through <strong>interactive content like emails, chat systems</strong>, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/06fc5bb6323e2f94050f3750a9667dbc.avif?t=1760257399\" width=1520 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Seoul to London to Tokyo \u2014 we\u2019re a global team turning imagination into reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our previous title, <i>Beginning of the Rain</i>, taught us more than just how to develop a game \u2014 it showed us how to grow with our audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe in building story-driven content that evolves through feedback, communication, and emotional connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our games aren\u2019t static; they\u2019re living, growing experiences shaped together with the players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras/7c0ec89eac0a972f92af441e6abafd56.avif?t=1760257399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/extras_big/7c0ec89eac0a972f92af441e6abafd56.avif?t=1760257399 width=1600 height=956 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copyright <strong>\u00a9\u00a0</strong>HOONDAHL STUDIOS LTD 2025 / All Rights Reserved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["HOONDAHL STUDIOS LTD"],"dlc":[3944390,3946200,3946210],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114280/849e624f9a5de3e07015788a90e2cddfdc517955/header.jpg?t=1760257399","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3114280/78768754/aecc68115b0e5861a7af45c549934e756b653edb/1751869676/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755339171","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3114280/78768754